    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do you ensure only the highest quality herbs?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We partner with a fifth-generation Taiwanese family company who have been sourcing and processing the highest-quality Chinese herbs since 1892.<br/><br/>Every batch of herbs is tested in a 5,000+ sqft laboratory before extraction - including DNA analysis, heavy metal, pesticide, chemical, and microbiological testing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do {{ product.title }} contain gelatin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, all Reprise gummies are vegan and do not contain animal products such as gelatin.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do you make bitter herbs tasty?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We use natural fruit flavors and paired them with each herb. We experimented and curated each herb-flavor pairing so you don’t have to.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Reprise's return policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 30-day risk-free return policy for all new customers. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, simply contact our customer support team within 30 days of receiving your order, and we will provide you with a return authorization and instructions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much sugar is in each gummy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Each gummy contains only 1g of sugar. Reprise gummies do NOT contain any artificial sweeteners.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Yt7XmQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I take Reprise {{ product.title }} while on prescription medications",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We do not recommend taking Reprise gummies and your prescription medications at the same time. We recommend always speaking with your healthcare provider prior to mixing any dietary supplements.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
